                                                "sense_id": "4427b921-80e9-3401-8a2c-8bbfbaa65982",
                                                "text": "This process provides an unpatternable sheet of silicon nitride that electrically isolates the devices […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4512124f-0bcc-4a34-8f97-172a7ac124c2",
